  "body": "RENOVATED, LOW-MAINTENANCE LIVING WITH STORAGE\r\n\r\nLooking for a home that's easy to live in, low maintenance and already has many of the important improvements taken care of? This well-positioned apartment at 18/340 Gulf Harbour Drive inside the SANTA ROSA apartment complex deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has been partly renovated and extensively upgraded, creating a fresh and comfortable home with many improvements already completed. The work includes a fully renovated bathroom, updated kitchen appliances, new doors and hardware throughout, upgraded window coverings, renovated wardrobes and recent painting both internally and externally.\r\n\r\nA brand-new heat pump, valued at approximately $3,000, has just been installed. This will provide an added level of comfort for the new owner - Not shown in photos. \r\n\r\nOne of the property's standout features is something you simply don't find in many apartments — approximately 50m² of attic storage floor space.  An attic access ladder has been installed, with the attic also featuring lighting and power points.  It provides an exceptional amount of additional storage and flexibility for belongings, hobbies, equipment and everything else that can be difficult to accommodate in an apartment.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU'LL WANT TO SEE IT:\r\n\r\n* Partly renovated and extensively upgraded\r\n* $3,000 brand-new heat pump has just been installed\r\n* Fully renovated bathroom\r\n* Upgraded kitchen cooktop, oven, rangehood and Insinkerator\r\n* New doors throughout, including new hinges, handles and door stops\r\n* New bedroom sliding door to maximise space\r\n* Upgraded curtains, curtain rods and roller blinds\r\n* Renovated wardrobes with new shelving and additional hanging space\r\n* Recently painted throughout, internally and externally\r\n* Attic access ladder\r\n* Approximately 50m² of attic storage floor space\r\n* Lighting and power points in the attic\r\n* Low-maintenance apartment resort lifestyle\r\n* Large swimming pool with tables and BBQ\r\n* Tennis Court\r\n* Ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors or those wanting an easy lock-up-and-leave property\r\n\r\nMORE THAN MEETS THE EYE\r\n\r\nThe combination of the renovations, modern improvements and exceptional attic storage makes this apartment stand out from the typical low-maintenance property.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is located in Gulf Harbour, with the area's coastal lifestyle and local amenities close by. Whether you're looking for your first home, a property to downsize into, an investment or simply somewhere easy to lock up and leave, this apartment offers plenty to consider. \r\n\r\nPrivate sale — viewings by appointment.\r\n\r\nIf you've been looking for an upgraded, low-maintenance apartment with an unusually generous amount of additional storage, come and take a look at 18/340 Gulf Harbour Drive.\r\n\r\nThe improvements are here. Now it could be your turn to make it home.\r\n\r\n\r\nBody corporate fees are payable quarterly",
